Cell["Loading Package", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"a83256c2-a2d8-4ad5-a5c2-1c111bc8ccf4"],

Cell["\<\
After make install, the package is loaded with << MBAnalytica.wl. The number \
of parallel subkernels is set by $KernelLaunch before the first evaluation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2a76fb30-f76f-4cac-ad99-b9f22eeda58d"],

