integrals that contribute to the RRV\[Times]V corrections, differential in \
the variable 0 < u < 1 (Section 6.3 of the paper).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4e0c284a-5f7d-483e-9e3f-e316f0a9b4fe"],

