package in examples/DoubleExchangeNearConformal.m, as an association from the \
order of \[Delta] to its coefficient. The coefficient of \[Delta]^0 reads\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"09319a7a-1177-4644-ab3e-92708e3dd62c"],

